{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o009b","title":"庞林随黄权征吴败后入魏","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o009b-account","label":"《庞统法正传第七》正文","text":"庞林参黄权征吴，军败随黄权入魏，受封列侯，后至钜鹿太守。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o009b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"pangfa-p0010","role":"参军降魏","evidence":["pangfa-e-o009b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0062","role":"征吴入魏","evidence":["pangfa-e-o009b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o009b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-o009b-q","source_order":[37,40,"O009b"],"order":6977},{"id":"pangfa-e-p008a","title":"庞林妻分隔守女后与庞林重聚","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-p008a-account","label":"《襄阳记》","text":"《襄阳记》记曹操破荆州时庞林与妻分隔，妻守养弱女十余年，至庞林随黄权降魏后重聚。","evidence":["pangfa-e-p008a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"pangfa-p0010","role":"分隔重聚","evidence":["pangfa-e-p008a-q"]},{"person":"pangfa-p0011","role":"守养重聚","evidence":["pangfa-e-p008a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"自曹公破荆州至庞林随黄权降魏后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["pangfa-e-p008a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-p008a-q","source_order":[37,61,"P008a"],"order":6978}],"persons":[{"id":"pangfa-p0010","name":"庞林","evidence":["pangfa-q-o009"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"pangfa-m-o009-pangfa-p0010","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o009"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-p008-pangfa-p0010","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-p008"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-ff5bce2e7f33d92dc39f","layer":"original","quote":"统弟林，以荆州治中从事，参镇北将军黄权〖15〗，征吴；值军败〖16〗，随权入魏。魏封列侯，至钜鹿太守。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-p008a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-a7cdca521d62a556dc9f","layer":"pei","quote":"曹公之破荆州，林妇与林分隔，守养弱女十有余年。后林随黄权降魏，始复集聚。","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dd047ad6e712f7bc0280","start":31,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o009","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-ff5bce2e7f33d92dc39f","layer":"original","quote":"统子宏，字巨师。刚简有臧否〖13〗，轻傲尚书令陈祗；为祗所抑，卒于涪陵太守〖14〗。统弟林，以荆州治中从事，参镇北将军黄权〖15〗，征吴；值军败〖16〗，随权入魏。魏封列侯，至钜鹿太守。﹝二﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-p008","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-a7cdca521d62a556dc9f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《襄阳记》曰：“林妇，同郡习祯妹。祯事在杨戏《辅臣赞》。曹公之破荆州，林妇与林分隔，守养弱女十有余年。后林随黄权降魏，始复集聚。魏文帝闻而贤之，赐床帐衣服，以显其义节。”","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dd047ad6e712f7bc0280","start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
